# Environment "corpipe": CorPipe 26 (supplementary.qmd S3: "CorPipe 26 ... with its umT5-xl one-stage model,
# instead resolves coreference on every English source"), run from ufal/crac2026-corpipe at the commit pinned
# in config/resources.lock.json. Its requirements.txt at that commit asks for:
#     minnt~=1.1, torch~=2.10.0, transformers~=5.2.0, sentencepiece, udapi~=0.5.1
# which conflict with core's torch 2.14.1 and transformers 5.19.0. The CorefUD scorer and validator packages
# of that file (pytest, scipy, regex) are left out, because the stage only predicts.
minnt~=1.1
# The cu126 build, as in core: the CUDA 12.6 runtime is the one already proven on ARC's L40S nodes.
torch~=2.10.0
transformers~=5.2.0
sentencepiece==0.2.2
udapi~=0.5.1
# For the editable, no-build-isolation install of intract_features (pyproject.toml: setuptools>=75).
setuptools>=75
